# SpaceScout V2 — Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API URL
# ----------------
# Local Development (Optional):
# If omitted, defaults to dynamically using http://<current_hostname>:8000 (or http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Production / Vercel (REQUIRED at build time):
# In production builds, this MUST be set to your backend service URL (e.g. Render).
# Vite bakes this value into static client bundles at build time.
# VITE_API_URL=https://spacescout-backend.onrender.com

# SECURITY NOTICE:
# Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is public and visible to anyone inspecting frontend JavaScript.
# NEVER store provider API keys, encryption keys, database passwords, or Django secret keys here.
